SCOPE

This MIT licence covers the SOFTWARE in this repository:

    engine/          Python engines, digitizers and solvers
    dctl/            DaVinci Resolve DCTL nodes
    *.md             documentation

It does NOT cover the generated transforms and digitized data:

    the .cube LUTs   distributed as release assets, not in the repo tree
    data/            digitized datasheet curves and derived spectral data

Those are licensed separately under CC BY 4.0 — see LICENSE-DATA.

Manufacturer datasheets are not distributed with this repository and are not
covered by either licence. See DATASHEETS.md.
